   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Possibility + «ものなら» presents something the speaker wishes for but considers difficult or unrealistic.",
     "texto": [
      "It often appears with ability verbs such as できる. It isn't a neutral condition for arranging routine plans.",
      "できる ものなら、昔 の 町並み を そのまま 残したい。 (If it were possible, I'd like to keep the old townscape exactly as it is.)",
      "会える ものなら、当時 の 記録 を 書いた 人 に 話 を 聞きたい。 (If it were possible, I'd like to talk to the person who wrote the records of that time.)"
